Render the final frame into a framebuffer the app chooses, not always FBO 0.

Backport of upstream projectM commit bd2b1ba9f ("Add API function to enable rendering to custom FBO IDs",
June 2024, after the 4.1 branch): adds projectm_opengl_render_frame_fbo(). The app uses it to draw projectM
at any internal size into its own texture and scale that to the screen (variable resolution), instead of
resizing the Android surface.

